q4os-desktop-plasma (4.14-uqka1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Turn off the plasma-welcome wizard with kwrtcfgpm instead of Trinity's kwriteconfig:
    on a Plasma install without Trinity the setting was never written, and new users
    got the KDE welcome wizard next to the Q4OS Welcome screen (trixie, forky, resolute).

 -- Q4OS Team <q4os@q4os.org>  Wed, 07 Oct 2026 19:48:54 +0200

q4os-desktop-plasma (4.13-uqka1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Recommend q4os-wificonnect5, the plain Qt5 frontend of the wireless connection
    tool the first login script (q4os-base 4.31.13-a1) runs. A recommendation
    like q4os-cpuq5 and q4os-welcome5: installed by default, removable, and harmless
    on a suite the tool is not built for yet.

 -- Q4OS Team <q4os@q4os.org>  Sat, 03 Oct 2026 23:00:00 +0200

q4os-desktop-plasma (4.12-uqka1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Depend on q4os-setup5, the Qt5 frontend of the Q4OS Setup utility: the
    setup frontend is the edition's hard dependency now (q4os-desktop-trinity
    has q4os-setup), q4os-desktop itself no longer names it - Plasma no longer
    needs the TDE frontend. /usr/bin/appsetup2.exu (q4os-setup-common) starts
    the frontend of the running session.

 -- Q4OS Team <devteam@q4os.org>  Sat, 03 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200

q4os-desktop-plasma (4.11-uqka1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Depend on q4os-sw-profiler5, the Qt5 Desktop Profiler frontend: the profiler
    frontend is the edition's hard dependency now (q4os-desktop-trinity has
    q4os-sw-profiler), q4os-desktop itself no longer names it - Plasma no longer
    needs the TDE frontend.
  * Depend on q4os-swcentre5 the same way, the Qt5 Software Centre frontend:
    q4os-desktop no longer names q4os-swcentre / q4os-swcentre-data (the
    Trinity edition keeps them in q4os-desktop-trinity; -data comes with
    q4os-swcentre-common).

 -- Q4OS Team <devteam@q4os.org>  Fri, 25 Sep 2026 09:31:05 +0200

q4os-desktop-plasma (4.10-uqka1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium
